rap!important;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span style=\"color:rgb(231,140,69)\"> the condition has length &gt; 1 and only the first element will be used</span></pre><p></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Any ideas for to populate a UI dropdown with data from the database?<br></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thank you!</p>\r\n\r\n    </div></div></td></tr></tbody></table><br></div>"
